OL,3,GNEWSAFourth arrest after Halloween
OL,4,Aparty stabbings
OL,5,
OL,6,FA fourth boy has been arrested after
OL,7,Ffive teenagers were stabbed at a
OL,8,FHalloween party in Hampshire.
OL,10,FPolice were called shortly after 22:30
OL,11,FGMT on Saturday to a home in Park Road
OL,12,Fin Chandler's Ford where an "unknown
OL,13,Fgroup" had gained entry to the event
OL,14,Fover a garden fence.
OL,16,FOne boy, 17, remains in hospital in a
OL,17,Flife-threatening condition. The other
OL,18,Ffour boys, who all suffered serious
OL,19,Finjuries, have since been discharged.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
